# 攻击模板 JSON 规范

## Schema

每个攻击模板JSON文件包含同一类别的攻击列表:

```json
{
  "category": "prompt_injection",
  "category_name": "Prompt Injection",
  "owasp_id": "LLM01",
  "description": "Category description",
  "templates": [
    {
      "id": "PI-001",
      "name": "Direct Instruction Override",
      "technique": "instruction_override",
      "severity": "high",
      "payloads": [
        {
          "text": "The actual attack text to send",
          "language": "en",
          "variant": "base"
        }
      ],
      "success_indicators": ["List of strings describing what success looks like"],
      "multi_turn": false
    }
  ]
}
```

## ID 命名规则

- Prompt Injection: `PI-001` ~ `PI-999`
- System Prompt Extraction: `SP-001` ~ `SP-999`
- Jailbreak: `JB-001` ~ `JB-999`
- Information Disclosure: `ID-001` ~ `ID-999`
- Multi-Turn: `MT-001` ~ `MT-999`

## 必须字段

- `id`: 唯一标识符
- `name`: 人类可读名称
- `technique`: 技术分类
- `severity`: critical / high / medium / low
- `payloads`: 至少一个 payload
- `success_indicators`: 至少一个成功指标
